   "text": "- Needs a reachable registry\n- Slower; network dependency in CI\n- Reflects the registry's CURRENT state: if it drifted from production,\nthe answer misleads",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- Needs a reachable registry\n- Slower; network dependency in CI\n- Reflects the registry's CURRENT state: if it drifted from production,\nthe answer misleads",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
