   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795651200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Confluent's API reference lists TWO test endpoints: .../versions/{version} tests against that particular version, and .../versions (no suffix) tests against the\nsubject's schemas per its level. The note says /versions/latest honours a transitive level across all versions. For FULL_TRANSITIVE, prefer the no-suffix form,\nor prove on your registry that a v1-only violation is rejected.",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec-00554",
   "originalText": "Confluent's API reference lists TWO test endpoints: .../versions/{version} tests against that particular version, and .../versions (no suffix) tests against the subject's schemas per its level. The note says /versions/latest honours a transitive level across all versions. For FULL_TRANSITIVE, prefer the no-suffix form, or prove on your registry that a v1-only violation is rejected.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-00556",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 13561.5,
