   "seed": 1014676908,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 656111827,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795651200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every pair, BOTH directions. Testing only v1-v2 and v2-v3 misses the v1-v3 gap (diagram 7).\n\nAbove the diagonal = a newer reader on old data (backward). Below = an older reader on new\ndata (forward).",
   "fontSize": 29,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Every pair, BOTH directions. Testing only v1-v2 and v2-v3 misses the v1-v3 gap (diagram 7).\n\nAbove the diagonal = a newer reader on old data (backward). Below = an older reader on new\ndata (forward).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-01052",
