   "updated": 1795651200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "For each rejected change class: (1) offline and registry checkers REJECT\nit, and (2) forcing it at runtime really throws or loses data. C10 as a\nregression suite.",
   "fontSize": 29,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "For each rejected change class: (1) offline and registry checkers REJECT\nit, and (2) forcing it at runtime really throws or loses data. C10 as a\nregression suite.",
